%% title: Feed gate state machine
%% source: firmware/esp32_feeder/esp32_feeder.ino:14-194 FeedPhase, feedStart, finishFeed, feedTick
%% source: firmware/esp32_feeder/config.h:69-71 open 1000 ms, settle 300 ms, gap 200 ms

stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> IDLE
  IDLE --> OPEN : feedStart accepted, phase IDLE and servo ready
  OPEN --> CLOSING : PORTION_OPEN_MS elapsed, 1000 ms
  CLOSING --> GAP : settle 300 ms elapsed and jobRemaining above 0
  CLOSING --> IDLE : settle 300 ms elapsed and jobRemaining is 0, finishFeed
  GAP --> OPEN : PORTION_GAP_MS elapsed, 200 ms

  IDLE : FEED_IDLE, servo closed, no job
  OPEN : FEED_OPEN, gate at 90 deg
  CLOSING : FEED_CLOSING, gate at 0 deg
  GAP : FEED_GAP, between portions

  note right of IDLE
    feedStart refuses when phase is not IDLE or the servo is not ready
    manual_feed also refuses when feed level is 0
  end note

  note right of CLOSING
    jobRemaining is decremented exactly once per portion
    at the end of the 300 ms settle phase
  end note

  note left of IDLE
    finishFeed closes the servo and measures distance
    scheduled job publishes state scheduled_feed then telemetry
    manual job publishes telemetry then ack ok
  end note
